terest for default in complying with terms of Sanction and Agreement\",\n      \"penaltyDetails\": \"Attracts additional interest of 1% per annum over and above the applicable Interest Rate from the expiry of stipulated time, with a 7-day notice period.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"2.5\",\n      \"description\": \"Default Interest\",\n      \"penaltyDetails\": \"Default Interest at the rate of 1% per annum, including any taxes as applicable, on the defaulted amount during the period of default, compounded monthly and payable on demand.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"arbitration_clause\": {\n    \"amicable_settlement\": \"Not explicitly mentioned, but standard practice is to attempt amicable settlement before arbitration.\",\n    \"arbitration\": \"All disputes arising out of or in connection with the Transaction Documents shall be governed by and construed in accordance with Laws of India. Jurisdiction is with courts/tribunals at Ahmedabad (Clause 12.2.1).\",\n    \"seat_and_venue\": \"Ahmedabad, India\",\n    \"final_and_binding \": \"The decision of the courts/tribunals at Ahmedabad shall be final and binding unless the Lender chooses to approach any other court, tribunal or alternate dispute resolution forum (Clause 12.2.2).\"\n  }\n}"